    LLM: 'Save your trumps for late in the game to avoid picking up a large pile of cards when the deck is empty.\n\nTeamwork: If you are the attacker, lead ranks that your partner (another attacker) can follow up with, to overwhelm the defender.\n\nCard Counting: Essential in a 32ndcard deck. Know which Queens (Overs) and Kings have been discarded to gauge when your 10s or 9s become safe beats.',
